[] 18/**         5*level + 410 - 10*(wounded legs)
[] 25            5*level + 380 - 10*(wounded legs)
[]
[] Interestingly enough, a strength of 25 doesn't allow as much of a carrying
[] capacity as 18/** does.

umm, you also need to know if your game was compiled with "HARD" as an
option.  if so, then your carrying capacity is severly constrained to an
upper limit of 120 else it's 500.  under "HARD" the capacity math is
slightly different but what is most noticeable is that a level 4
character with strength greater than 18 cannot hope to carry any more!
for similar reasons, gauntlets of power often times don't appear to do
much.  hopefully this will change in future versions ...

